{"title":"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a triangle with integer side lengths, one side is three times as long as a second side, and the length of the third side is 15. What is the greatest possible perimeter of the triangle?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b07ec5812293ddfcaf9baafaacc942585114137c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A) } 43 \\qquad \\text {(B) } 44 \\qquad \\text {(C) } 45 \\qquad \\text {(D) } 46 \\qquad \\text {(E) } 47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"376\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the second size has length x, then the first side has length 3x, and we have the third side which has length 15. By the triangle inequality, we have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/3698c4481b5cdf7c03410f60f4167019bca52c79.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\ x+15&gt;3x \\Rightarrow 2x&lt;15 \\Rightarrow x&lt;7.5\\]\" width=\"269\" height=\"14\" /> Now, since we want the greatest perimeter, we want the greatest integer x, and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/e/9de0d92384d2976b053ff3110d0901bf7a21a6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;7.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f6230166a491e7a471a03829c792496576480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />. Then, the first side has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f437a569f421ec44ffad1febd55f8139e07eeefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3*7=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, the second side has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the third side has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and so the perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d13ed86cd7017a7db6e7181a35524a3eacf65b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21+7+15=43 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\text {(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B\">2006 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Prob